 "caps": [
  [
   2.295,
   5.05,
   "Feel that? A shiver."
  ],
  [
   7.115,
   10.65,
   "Tiny sensors in your skin feel the air cool…"
  ],
  [
   10.62,
   13.87,
   "and quietly let your brain know."
  ],
  [
   15.975,
   19.33,
   "Your brain answers in two soft steps."
  ],
  [
   20.98,
   21.67,
   "First,"
  ],
  [
   21.64,
   25.405,
   "the little blood vessels near your skin narrow."
  ],
  [
   25.375,
   28.39,
   "Warm blood stays deeper inside you."
  ],
  [
   30.395,
   32.325,
   "Then, if you're cold…"
  ],
  [
   32.295,
   34.96,
   "your muscles begin to tremble."
  ],
  [
   34.93,
   38.455,
   "Not on purpose. Tiny, quick tightenings,"
  ],
  [
   38.425,
   40.61,
   "over and over."
  ],
  [
   42.655,
   44.6,
   "They do just one thing."
  ],
  [
   44.57,
   46.555,
   "They make heat."
  ],
  [
   46.525,
   52.11,
   "A strong shiver makes several times more than your body makes at rest."
  ],
  [
   54.015,
   55.625,
   "And goosebumps?"
  ],
  [
   55.595,
   60.09,
   "The same signal reaches the tiny muscle beside each hair…"
  ],
  [
   60.06,
   62.41,
   "and lifts it upright."
  ],
  [
   64.28,
   67.695,
   "One cool breeze. Skin, nerves,"
  ],
  [
   67.665,
   69.75,
   "vessels and muscle,"
  ],
  [
   69.72,
   72.455,
   "all answering together. All…"
  ],
  [
   72.425,
   74.63,
   "without asking you."
  ],
  [
   77.325,
   79.315,
   "If you're feeling a little calmer,"
  ],
  [
   79.285,
   82.39,
   "tap like and follow."
  ]
